    					"status": "started",
    					"step": ["bank"],
    					"lines": ["You're carrying half the lawn. Use a Bank Booth in the main hall and deposit what you don't need.", "The bank holds four hundred stacks. I've seen Presidents fill it with Scrap Hash. Don't be that President. And never keep the truth in only one place."]
