    					"status": "started",
    					"step": ["battlemage"],
    					"lines": ["Splendid! Now a Battlemage. They were our best teachers before the Rugmancer's spell.", "Two of them guard the way to the north tower, and more patrol the Dueling Grounds. Beat one and the spell on it breaks. Mind their bolts; they hit hard."]
